{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"以賽亞書","commonName":"以賽亞書","title":"以賽亞書","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"37240f583e914ba42181e29fd451e0e08b4e7c4e2af1563522da6f6a9285f631","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":19,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["關於埃及的預言"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是關於埃及的預言：",{"text":"看啊，耶和華駕著疾馳的雲來到埃及。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的偶像在祂面前顫抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人膽戰心驚。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我必使埃及人彼此為敵——手足相殘，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鄰居互鬥，城邑相爭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"邦國互攻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及人必灰心喪志，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必破壞他們的計謀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必求問偶像、巫師、靈媒和術士。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必將埃及人交給一位殘忍的主人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一位暴君必統治他們。」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主——萬軍之耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"海水必枯竭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"河床必乾涸。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"溝渠必發臭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的河流逐漸枯竭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蘆葦和燈心草必枯死，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尼羅河兩岸青草枯黃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田地龜裂，莊稼被風吹去，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蕩然無存。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有在尼羅河下鉤的漁夫都哀哭悲傷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在河上撒網的人都傷痛。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"紡麻織布的人一籌莫展，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"陷入絕望。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及的顯貴萎靡不振","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"僱工們都憂心忡忡。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"瑣安的官長愚不可及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"法老聰明的謀士盡出下策。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們怎敢在法老面前自稱是智者之子，古代君王之後？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"法老啊，你的智者在哪裡呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓他們把萬軍之耶和華對付埃及的計劃告訴你吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"瑣安的首領愚昧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗的首領糊塗。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們是埃及各支派的房角石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"卻把埃及人引入歧途。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華使錯謬的靈進入他們當中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他們像又嘔又吐、東倒西歪的醉漢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"做什麼都錯誤百出。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及從頭到尾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從權貴到草根必一籌莫展。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["到那日，當萬軍之耶和華揮手懲罰的時候，埃及人必恐懼顫抖，如柔弱的女子。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["他們必對猶大充滿恐懼，一聽見猶大的名字就害怕，因為萬軍之耶和華定下計劃要對付他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["到那日，埃及必有五座城的人講迦南的語言，並起誓效忠萬軍之耶和華，其中有一座必叫滅亡城",{"noteId":9},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["到那日，埃及境內必有一座為耶和華築的祭壇，邊境必有一根為耶和華立的石柱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["這是萬軍之耶和華在埃及的記號和憑據。埃及人因受到欺壓就呼求耶和華，祂必差遣一位救主保護、拯救他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和華必向埃及人彰顯自己。到那日，埃及人必認識祂，帶著祭物和供物來敬拜祂，向祂許願還願。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["耶和華必擊打他們，也必醫治他們。他們必歸向耶和華，祂必應允他們的禱告，醫治他們。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["到那日，必有一條大道連接埃及和亞述，兩國人民互相往來，一同敬拜耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["到那日，以色列必與埃及和亞述一同成為世人的祝福。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["萬軍之耶和華必賜福給他們，說：「我的子民埃及、我的創作亞述、我的產業以色列都有福了！」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"死海古卷為「埃及的織布者都崩潰」。","reference":{"chapter":19,"verse":10}},{"noteId":9,"caller":"+","text":"「滅亡城」有些抄本作「太陽城」。","reference":{"chapter":19,"verse":18}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/19.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/20.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ISA/18.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":25}